# ORBIT online build — the hosted site WITH accounts, email confirmation and a
# shared galaxy. Copy to `.env.online` (gitignored) and fill in a real Supabase
# project. Find the values under Project Settings -> API.
#
# This file is only a template. The anon key is safe to ship in a web bundle
# (RLS is what protects the data), but keeping it out of the repo keeps the
# project ref private and lets you rotate the key without a commit.
#
# Use the absolute project URL — the relative `/sb` proxy only exists on the dev
# server and on the work-host preview, not on GitHub Pages.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<anon-key>
